# Inputs of the exit image (deploy/phala/Dockerfile, context = repo root): everything is excluded, then the inputs
# are let back in. Keep this list equal to EXIT_IMAGE_INPUTS in scripts/exit-image-common.sh (a test compares them).
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/shared
!enclave
!client/package.json
!mcp/package.json
!e2e/package.json
# tests are not built into the image (EXIT_IMAGE_INPUTS excludes the same two directories)
enclave/test
packages/shared/test
# never inputs, even inside the directories above: build output and what .gitignore keeps out of the repo
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/target
**/.sandbox
**/.run
**/.env
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.claude
